    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Owner of The Happy Scrimshander.</strong> Retired assassin. Doughy spinster of few words. Sells needles, knives, inks, and wax for scrimshaw work.</p>\n<p>She doesn't talk about her shady past except to speak fondly of people she once knew who have since died. She knows where bodies are buried \u2014 literally.</p>\n<p><strong>Stats:</strong> Assassin stat block (MM). AC 15, HP 78. Proficient in disguise kit and poisoner's kit. Death Strike on surprised creatures (double damage, DC 15 CON or auto).</p>"
      },
